      "content": "but you said \"you don't belong here because you're not good enough\"... that's exactly it. it's not just a feeling. it's a fact. i look at the people around me and they have this light, this purpose, and i just have this heavy, dark emptiness where a person should be. how do you even live with knowing you're just a net negative to the world?",
